  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "三塗五岳，陽城太室。神明所住，獨無兵革。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a7026ca7af1e6c07ad343e3a2e72dfdf801542851ce6e1af4b8a0c20c407a821",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e2dc52559720995c47d6ebb1b3087f11248c225c107e2dc2214aebc12681099c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "軟弱無輔，不能自理。意在外野，心懷勞苦。雖憂不殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9358ff656ec187bf6379fd18adaaad65a2492b746493e88086fb391cffa3ea99",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:765db05ad3f7054c5adae20eb62c3f8c6a1eaf77799beda35c097914a5dc444d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "周成之隆，刑措無凶。大眾讚佑，君子作仁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:463bb860245be371337a91b671ecc64f8745c893e9c7f6172aeb8e1ceba07957",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dbe1909ba3a095ce37adca7ba7c69bf9facc1ebb902eeb1e4661d38c8d6d86db"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "穴有狐烏，坎生蝦蟆。象去萬里，不可得捕。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:66bb62f47b23214de2739b784141efa7879c661e56bb05d876f69b23d0e29d69",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:01b1c1622813330e880a8b5e853f326cfe9da7e6e5f3a8dd21be3dbe06d79477"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "俱為天民，雲過吾面。治民嫉妒，與我無恩。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:63ce0639e72b89766857798fc6bc7069b51f107a656c9115087f9a016f752861",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d6e2ef1afd5634b2adf20ceac85ab7b06c2a6da3033bc1918428ac7683d265ff"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "三首六目，政多煩惑。皋陶瘖聾，亂不可從。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1554b4d63447a5d4788bcdb25eb543620aa963ddcee4967259885bae0c7670f5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:62904225de26a33be0d61ecb4097b243f54f5b46c8f4cc32826be9d6a418088a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "德積不輕，辭王釣耕。三媒不已，大福來成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:567ec7d359bb38854bdefa964b63b3027dedcf4168441d6499a05bac7a96d0b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1f5017c68df22847365f5c0331d801cb55eb7d9b0d2e2872c3abf1ca1accf058"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "堅固相親，日用自完。六體不易，孰為安全。雨師駕西，濡我轂輪。張伯李季，各噬關門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6536e941cd754d408a55b75bbdfa98caa5027f16811b66d828cf92cae8f435de",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b5e044c053405336194429935ca42a90a754a6c65188e0b462081abaae6aabb3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "方內不行，輻摧輪傷。馬禁隄與，愛子閔時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b39a2a787148a19c2beeb1e2ddbb454af27fbdba9105fb9c7e40d0bd14347728",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8c553b739d58eb2d1bd1f4507703bd43b4cc6a388297d6a8f4ba054959d210ce"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "畜牝無駒，養雞不雛。群羊三歲，不生兩頭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9467cee223dbd7181d7ce684b3319d14c9f2c693443cd953fef699bd71bfe2e0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6682eb9f91fe435880aadb3a10ae1fd2fa57b07f0c718f82148a4eec2c3b767d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "老耄罷極，無取中直。懸輿致仕，得歸鄉國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:05e0c732d8c6c89a7a4657f691e8040e7e1ce94efbe6cf950510e9ab7906438d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c6e1e4f53d2bee7271f93355c0a0eee6b55c5779e1173c5eee21a2c5e9fc9dca"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "縮緒亂絲，手與為災。越畝逐兔，斷其褌襦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0fdd31018514513ff2ed740b461589bdf173daaee245639ed2e440787fa734e8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8d2363f817881f503d88edc267576919e407bbed67a74ae9d1e8dc80caa4b717"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "海老水乾，魚鱉蕭索。高落無澗，獨有沙石。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eafae4dd36de04da00a0617249b8e88bf073eb6342485363aa1ae9932744f2fd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92485791c3e8b63e4dfb32bad923b1a2f3e9c1b58bbeff835ac34d8c871dda41"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "入市求鹿，不見頓足。終日至夜，竟無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:437bec5f0bfba71a1f9f37a73557a4f93dfe146610b7af978592e70554b62cd7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:412aac9985b50ad10073be87390359e619ba0c659706f37d7ba41c5c05f0b75b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "築門壅戶，虎臥當道。驚我驊騮，不利出處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bb239a58bf619970fd4a33793aaaedb703d94205891476d8614c6b59b5641dd2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eba6d6d351100d25d6d47aa7a604a7e9e48f1e66be321fb9eee2c4bb7bd5fa5a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "陶朱白圭，善賈息資。公子王孫，富貴不貧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:99b931e91fa7f67faa37f7d47a5db7182210b6c4cc74579c6559c282984defab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9530d5cd5228abb32ed5dc56101a9ebd895c3c65bb4939f44c4963ada2f8b101"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "王良善御，伯樂知馬。周旋步驟，行中規矩。止息有前，延命壽考。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8759c2e010886b20834a3c25bcbf3fd54417f129a95205efc45c393b303e3cfb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6ab2d6f1bd69e65b2ce1c10aa2e3c5f6b5911ceabd0e8c32a66c0b6ea7f23168"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "堯問大舜，聖德增益。使民不懼，安無怵惕。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:709fc9f0bb72668d2121450aa2db5b70af5b45f257c3e9f95efa8dc0fc97f42d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ee46d5d291f83a281fcacd9dd9aaa7c43d652eadd2d9f16f61469b19352b1ae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "昭公失常，季氏悖狂。遊齊處鄆，喪其寵身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:81083faed8f4c2ca001233b4c7dd5e0342abb899c868e8986bfb2f0b4876f1de",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fa16f5164ff91a917311dfafa225eda041084235db1caf2518dd6b53f55e55fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "昏暮不行，候旦待明。復住止後，未得相從。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8f897f08c39b60bb5660580c3d400a3b301aec468b6fe574fe67c0afec2eb104",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cc5d9501f6473e079f4559ab2791392e67a491a34309b537aee232cb018eea34"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "安止宜官，一日九遷。升擢超等，牧養常山。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6c946353fc531d1226acb71d5203e086fa67bc7aa8eaa1ae26501b6ea783bb6b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7adfd47582306a580f430c3961ae8a1f2e62cb98eebd5e8f4c1fb77177279404"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "去惡就凶，東西多訟，行者無功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4ac7fccdf03f0915a5ba23ebea76112181e051c3bc5c4201b4047f68caa4a586",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:59cb937fd1a71d3b06b88d3e8466a81d32b0898babebc1ac9ee78cd032aff606"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "老馬垂耳，不見百里。君子弗恃，商人莫取。無與為市。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d29acfe6565b57c1657d16cf0c250a4c8353d55d1d6e5674a7d8f59ab4b32e89",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0ad8186ccd55ef6b367845a241d3ba38a64a9c1b69752bda4bde70e1f314d703"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "蟙螺生子，深自黑醜。似類其母，雖或相就。眾人莫取。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:948acffbdb7be2976f90c7691a47bf62b463cfbecef3df61cd0f4a4dd87359ca",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a7d1827dd8133d7fad9a7b79dfa27a5cbd9df4b03aba1cbd59fd1808bdfee242"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "百足俱行，相輔為彊。三聖翼事，王室寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aff52eb0ba2f5566cf57e43bda90aa8419a53ef8a2c12e0b07784541db317d85",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e0c5a7c9fe0992c7ac37ff29e2f217d6764947e2e3a9e19b65f8e221403df24a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "容民蓄眾，履德有信。大人受福，童蒙憂惑。利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bb60fb5eefaad3256f43170aa4b8fd4684d92b2fc7fa182fd32f8da6092fd77a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1703f79fc88b1663fdea1008309862828c9b5156c133298a44566b88b5edacab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "左跌右僵，前躓觸桑。其稽據石，傷其弟兄。老蠶不作，家無織帛。貴貨賤身，久留連客。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7c7207cca82f7229152878d6e66f6f9174071ca7f235613ca48bdd1026a3ce9c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:04cb457270d3e049e6607685ba54e19835a7471c4aba92fb358c78359f27558e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "昏人旦明，賣食老昌。國祚東表，號稱太公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e2d18f1542de51233638bcca759b2308d5c2ea02b560b21e529d28e250c7065b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3130ba3bad59583f86429d4e26cde7535f48ae01ac018fdd331a39b902f1c38a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "敝笱在梁，魴逸不禁。漁父勞苦，焦喉乾口。虛空無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ac3af4016363d3d6a823f09823d12707a35abfe06e4d43cc8c175f2b15ae6e1e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:658364f4f0efe649b2e22b6e41a7160dd5a368d75ae8e9de9888f6fb00b8d58b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "盛中後跌，衰者復掇。盈滿或毀，疾羸肥腯。鄭昭失國，重耳興立。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e8b45105a549be5b44b8452191c30913c71ae54f2d7656f80a80e8c94fc42f9b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ad8061d22bb5743178632c6e114f83334deabb4a0ffe857bb4f855a458242666"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "折亡破甕，使我困貧。與母生分，別離異門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db43663dcdcc115181c229f2a47bb469d4759b8dbb95dc814ffceef365461476",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8011b6e17b055422f1a981bb7abb7ef6a8b018e1b2a24829dda5d9151058f9c0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "野有積庾，嗇人駕取。不逢狼虎，暮歸其宇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9658fbf371297640b9b03692177c841fd5554e74aa06c12ea2756167fb09e129",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7f99de6aae7c1887121153a41a4fa13a4c05b48f183fbf01aad1f28b51e1ee2e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "襁褓孩孤，冠帶成家。出門如賓，父母何憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d903a0566bcc13795038257952a0fe0d9c6e1bc4696b3e6e344cff67f86742bb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1b98e6115db64e7ad0c8dab3a2d493f519af3b45a901bfd4b0c89af0bf0b6277"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "陳力就列，官職無廢。手不勝盆，失其寵門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bd49b38337c02f2bdb7a510015df3408b8d871a674e0dc5cf2f835b9017ed423",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b4621499b9a653d128a8193add7337c4126786eff62af1990e81bebb3806191"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "積雪大寒，萬物不生。陰制庶士，時本寒貧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:466f8859c20562d0e41dc098064d4304629386003ca078b2af6304937fe1ade9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4329f4960cc83930bff5d76f17eebb754d50d9c989c5c73b42c1fe91333a0d8c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "龍鬥海門，失理傷賢。內畔生賊，自為心疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aa71ab36306f8c4f80622388f6a74a2153a632b5ceb58ae53073f8a5cafa9ac1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3ceba999a1ed779972b39e39aee79e1031605644b1737740eca0ad8f52c8cd2a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "不畏猛虎，依人為輔。三夫執獸，伏不敢起。身安無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8737c24098c91cb774b30dfd8f8ce52627794df3c65313e36a62514a9006612f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3efe1adc7725dc4a9b6f67776284263e264cd897838b0e360c2ab0e5fc352fff"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "南山高岡，回隤難登。道路遼遠，行者無功。憂不改凶，惡亦消去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:73c3899b2b3d1fc1e9e3f2cbb8fe063018955f9aef54494585f407ceae5a52a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1392a2d2e248e63164e0138eb54ea7ed9f104ca4fab12b7b608c6747a087284b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "逢時陽遂，富且尊貴。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b2af847ec44c94d0fb15a6a71a48238704679acc56ef5590daa828994211109b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:318d407242cc9ccac8e44566d43381209e97020baeff8ce14949c29a597604f7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "求我所欲，得其利福。終身不辱，盈盛之門。高屋光覆，君先其固。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9d6f47b53cab90341721c74924cd1af66905ff96d175e32095da5b637880f83c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:20b69827f55cf01b53c8e234131da3454b8f827b55aeb9275b1dda6221d243b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "安坐至暮，禍災不到。利詰妒姝，皇宥不赦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8ef79d0f9da229d9975bdb7fde394309d0a67b266bfe20a6c43cca7641f5db71",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e8fdd28be99aa11b6a22657e6795acbc2d31cec84d8db6b7e13227a3ac896520"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "膠車駕東，與雨相逢。五楘（一作婺）解墮，頓斬獨宿。憂為身福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fa2b1699dcea5b9a199b59cb65c2caa8dc30a657ad32c74c538d021a308b380f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bb6eb61f082eb6e13cc2335aaef4be4150534a0285851ce29430e8a387d85ec7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "擇日高飛，遠至東齊。見孔聖師，徒我相諧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bbd94e94daea158b420eb9fcb3aef3d0aa1a04684cf76cb02bd9ec9c992e8d94",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8fb7ac31240745591cf09baa55b696ccaf265ebee54d7a032befcf65450c6ae8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "陳媯敬仲，兆興齊姜。乃適營丘，八世大昌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8b9521d23f2ec94212bf64bad17df022d71605639cf335daf5c8afa3956b3455",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5845f1c1170e79ab653d40cc5cbd70d6c52ac4c2b12d17298a14462a2c09be58"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "缺將無憚，難從東西。毀破我盆，泛棄酒食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e5691377c0c2d46dd3c063baa5b2e280398981bce7f56d687a9348f3ae9037dd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d22da1063f67d1694a220747deabbe17d55337dfae8ded616d260824d8dcb235"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "中夜狗吠，盜在廬外。神光佐助，消散歸去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1cdc7ee2535647c1d928dd2a89cde21c1f011719c6f6a7b5879e588f0234978a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a9c56846e793dff08e7d6826f11c5db77b11eb9c1492f1ba2cfc9415260e0a1c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "雷車不藏，隱隱西行。霖雨三旬，流為河江。使我憂心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:160b1b781a3aa13471d9b51d3f31e993104da629fb9493f936919fe4949b9ab3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:107b4ea7ee08dfe2bb4873c9d5198aee74c3e31949c2ff6e0d1de7cb08b2b8ab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "老河空虛，舊井無魚。利得不饒，避患東鄰。福來入門，使我悔存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cb650a7d9b18a95af3df279b5957abf7c09c758486384ed30dbc3925667c6513",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b209443044fa1835d0f3f7b10b9f7859b2a8b1cfadc3a782f934fba354a57263"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "福德之士，歡悅日喜。夷吾相國，三歸為臣。貴流子孫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:21c69ffd5fb39e84612f51f410025509f222d5251accc76344b75d8ed4f70173",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df231bafd4a606dbd13ab4b04f2fabaf6cfefa15bf9d9af6d994c581fb460d61"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "清人高子，久屯外野。逍遙不歸，思我慈母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0c7ab1a62717d05d13a4a9bcd9d1533a288e2b58ae4ef9956e3cadefd6722b39",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca87c900bee02ae912b172fa31b4a17ab20a163343be4491ad7b47e5135d8c48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "驄 黑，東歸高鄉。白虎推輪，蒼龍把衡。朱雀導引，靈鳥載遊。遠扣天門，入見真君。馬全人安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d0c7af38f4709ac518c2c2c5d503fb1a3691ae25591bc263bf74ce66ae331ed1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f001137f6fb7f67ae3c8962d2226a7ed88f084ef4be94857107bfe6dbb387ba5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "路多枳棘，前刺我足。不利旅客，為心作毒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0eed13cd46eba3c469558cf92ebfd8d69934956abb684d295a47050bc41b93d4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c6eec075265117cc5ca5bf2c4c42570d8d2c5646baa1c4d82de4d9b9e6afff89"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "端坐生患，憂來入門，使我不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e698b82045142090ad6783e42b8e7c0ad846eca88b30d0b55b84db79c0d67b17",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d859e0938510ffb35435ab7c66cd2b09a2d1f83b70708a3f50f987533b6298fa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "小陬之市，利不足喜。二世積仁，蒙其祖先。匪躬之言，狂悖為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d43a2061b07e9ad13b0e27fd735088c45d6a5c943d4ec4ab000e8c152e62a275",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:472681c2229eefbe9e7944db30996981676f9d14fa9f1343748516f16dbcee1a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "登高望時，見樂無憂。求利南國，與寶相得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a4088fca39a614761d10ea72e7f7ba314358ba6d53d7a13191348da51d1c1a21",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1183312cce36d01d68969ac253494b2eac22c16976cbc051c1e9137eefd1daa9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "跛足息肩，有所忌難。金城鐵郭，以銅為關。藩屏自衛，安土無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3f097f339269e81008c8c5d337649116d34027f468d00efcb85d135b01cd1618",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a7b9ba47570df45e1973428c9e8f4b04c621b94d1785832d7a049bb2a4430d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "江水沱汜，思附君子。伯仲處市，不我肯顧。姪娣恨悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fa681b9291e56f87aafbd3907fe8b50e4f754df09b057461f08f5e62249a3457",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6b605e981f4177c0ef63cf9bf45d47fd6b01f98b34c4eef95ca025796eb805a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "芽糵生達，陽唱於外。左手執籥，公言錫爵。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:06c2a259f7985cd5380d8e31b25ec64b7a7900be12efdb864511a23712dcb489",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5f7fdc2788c84e5cc75b76a984cb04fced90983ab7b713ba1667bc30c306e6ba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "雲夢苑囿，萬物蕃熾。犀象玳瑁，荊人以富。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4853febaaa05264ae57d065c3252f02d409a278850ce8ee86eda712e979bf47c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e6e7c3321329af5fc75fa27510c13688b3f1360dd69eb53d7bf4749ce7e8347a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "渠戎萬里，晝夜愁苦。櫜甲戍服，雖荷不賊。鷹鸇之殃，害不能傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0dadad694f515d8345a6062f79c4591267bccbf51dfb0535deba02a1df435425",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3fc6b5c6e5af6a7a0784bad85a96c5ff607882bf49784f8e8ca5fa5e749f8b69"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "出門東行，日利辰良。步騎與駟，徑歷京邦。暮宿北燕，與樂相逢。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:21fb84d9193f266d8034a373a5e3d1f26ba900035f102a942d319d94a5021f43",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c1d9733b04a50486cd6727838fff0c51e0b2f3195e611cffda0d25e9eef25d91"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "騎騅與蒼，南賈太行。逢蛟猛虎，為所吞餐。葬於渭陽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e73da7d3990da64b15879715ca6f0620277c5d21cd9f04516d98bac8d5b485c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4e88fb5ef9481219d9c6a3486a19484bd5da391b7c513db3c660c7fdcd9f4070"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "鎡基逢時，稷契皋陶。貞良得願，微子解囚。市恐無虎，謾言妄語。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:05fd87e59f1abefb53db5ecf1e8543c07c17528a8135a72ef964dc17ebfd8c4a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:347cf5826ffdc8d110ad8d5e960dd4183d4769efcbdb798537843e7460b4930c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 33,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "酒為歡伯，除憂來樂。福善入門，與君相索。使我有得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c578aaa0caa0b1a974769fb6e403de01d35e469a83859428e0764df5f353b131",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:52e4dda77d91d2ca256c5ca468ca002cadeed77aff070b70b4ce182bce85b413"
    }
  ]
}
